  blob = nullptr;
}
```

When `fontDicts.fini_deep()` is called on a vector that's already in error state (allocated == 0), it will iterate over elements and call `fini()` on each. But `arrayZ()` returns `static_array` when `arrayZ_ == nullptr`. So it will iterate over elements in `static_array`.

